- [ ] Coding-standard checks satisfied.
- [ ] No deferred work: every anchor type in spec §Retrieval Engine step 2 — paths, symbols, errors, commands, APIs, config keys — has a variant, extractor, resolver path, and test.
- [ ] All resolution paths call the Phase 1 `IdentityResolver` (no parallel implementation).
- [ ] Diagnostics view is exported and exercised by a test, ready to be consumed by T29 (candidates), T30 (scoring), and T36 (working-memory inspector).

